  "description": "Introducing Cicobal, an imaginative Graffiti Bubble Cartoon Font crafted by the creative minds at Rasiorise Studio.\nDesigned with the street arts aesthetics in mind, Cicobal takes its cues from the “throwup Graffiti” and Bubble styles, resulting in an edgy yet playful typeface.\nThis dynamic font offers three defining character styles: Regular, Monoline, and Shadow. Each style adds a different layer of depth and texture to your design, making the typeface as versatile as it is captivating. With a combination of uppercase and lowercase letters, numerals, and multi-lingual support, Cicobal is the perfect solution for bringing a unique and edgy flavor to your creative projects.\nImagine Cicobal as being the street artist of typefaces, breathing life, colour, and rebellion into every word it forms. Each style within this typeface family  Regular Character, Monoline Character, and Shadow Character, channels a distinct personality, offering you countless ways to engage your audience visually.\nUnleash your creativity with Cicobal – Graffiti Bubble Cartoon Font. Because when it comes to design, sometimes it’s fun to color outside the lines!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Cicobal, an imaginative Graffiti Bubble Cartoon Font crafted by the creative minds at Rasiorise Studio.<br>\nDesigned with the street arts aesthetics in mind, Cicobal takes its cues from the “throwup Graffiti” and Bubble styles, resulting in an edgy yet playful typeface.</p>\n<p>This dynamic font offers three defining character styles: Regular, Monoline, and Shadow. Each style adds a different layer of depth and texture to your design, making the typeface as versatile as it is captivating. With a combination of uppercase and lowercase letters, numerals, and multi-lingual support, Cicobal is the perfect solution for bringing a unique and edgy flavor to your creative projects.</p>\n<p>Imagine Cicobal as being the street artist of typefaces, breathing life, colour, and rebellion into every word it forms. Each style within this typeface family  Regular Character, Monoline Character, and Shadow Character, channels a distinct personality, offering you countless ways to engage your audience visually.</p>\n<p>Unleash your creativity with Cicobal – Graffiti Bubble Cartoon Font. Because when it comes to design, sometimes it’s fun to color outside the lines!</p>",
